WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.690
Look at this giraffe.

2
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.710
Look at that long, long neck.

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.950
So how did giraffes
get such long necks?

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.650
Did each giraffe stretch
its neck a little more,

5
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.150
year after year?

6
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.030
And did it pass that
stretch on to its calves?

7
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:19.550
In this mission, you'll follow
natural selection, step by step,

8
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.090
and meet the scientist
who explained it.

9
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.690
You'll see how a species
changes over many generations,

10
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.330
and why some species die out.

11
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.870
And you'll find out how
scientists store seeds to protect

12
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.730
plants for the future.

13
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.230
Your mission: decide whether
giraffes got long necks by

14
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.410
stretching.
